@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Listar rectangulos
GET {{baseUrl}}/rectangulos

### Obtener un rectangulo
GET {{baseUrl}}/rectangulos/1

### Crear un rectangulo
POST {{baseUrl}}/rectangulos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ladoA": 3,
  "ladoB": 4
}

### Actualizar un rectangulo
PUT {{baseUrl}}/rectangulos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ladoA": 5,
  "ladoB": 6
}

### Eliminar un rectangulo
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/rectangulos/1